    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22617" root="شفر" body-key="$">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشفر</span></b>  is said in the Tekmileh to signify <i>He</i>
(a camel) <i>strove,</i> or <i>exerted himself, in running:</i>
but perhaps it should be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشغر</span>, mentioned before
[in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شغر</span>]. (TA.)

